{"seq":3,"slug":"optimization","title":"性能优化","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/realtime-rendering-pipeline/optimization","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"culling-batching","title":"剔除与批处理策略","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/realtime-rendering-pipeline/optimization/culling-batching","wordCount":1631,"readingTime":7},{"seq":2,"slug":"lod-streaming","title":"LOD 与资源流送","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/realtime-rendering-pipeline/optimization/lod-streaming","wordCount":1689,"readingTime":7},{"seq":3,"slug":"gpu-driven-rendering","title":"GPU 驱动渲染","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/realtime-rendering-pipeline/optimization/gpu-driven-rendering","wordCount":1694,"readingTime":7}],"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"性能优化\">性能优化</h1><p>本章聚焦如何让渲染管线在有限硬件预算内达到目标帧率。</p>\n<p>第一篇覆盖剔除与批处理——通过减少无效工作和合并绘制调用来降低 CPU/GPU 负载。第二篇讲解 LOD 与资源流送——在视觉质量与内存/带宽消耗之间取得动态平衡。第三篇介绍 GPU 驱动渲染——将传统 CPU 侧的场景管理工作迁移到 GPU，借助间接绘制与 Mesh Shader 突破 Draw Call 瓶颈。</p>\n<p>三种优化策略分别对应不同的性能瓶颈：CPU 提交、内存带宽、以及 CPU-GPU 协作效率。实际项目中往往需要组合使用。</p>\n"}